      <h2 id="persistent-storage-csi-smb-cifs-limits_persistent-storage-csi-smb-cifs" class="group scroll-mt-20">Limitations of the CIFS/SMB Driver Operator<a href="#persistent-storage-csi-smb-cifs-limits_persistent-storage-csi-smb-cifs" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
